### Fitting MG94 with double instantaneous substitutions
* Log(L) = -22620.12, AIC-c = 45525.92 (142 estimated parameters)
* non-synonymous/synonymous rate ratio =   0.1648
* rate at which 2 nucleotides are changed instantly within a single codon =   0.1917
